Appendix H. Implementation and Numerical Methods

H.1 Simulation Pseudocode

```text
Algorithm 1: Coupled Civilization Simulation
Input: initial state Z0, policy function π, time horizon T, delay vector τ, noise level σ
Output: trajectory {Z_t}

Initialize history for t in [-τ_max, 0] as Z0
for t = 0 to T step dt:
    u_t = π(Z_t)
    drift = F(Z_t, Z_{t-τ}, u_t)
    diffusion = Σ(Z_t)
    dW = sqrt(dt) * randn()
    Z_{t+dt} = Z_t + drift * dt + diffusion * dW
    store Z_{t+dt}
end
```

